    "Opens nope. and starts a series of photos at a fixed interval. Needs Manual Controls on in nope. Settings.": {
      "comment": "Describes nope.'s Start Interval Shooting action in the Shortcuts app. \"Manual Controls\" is the option's name in Settings. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Öffnet nope. und startet eine Fotoserie in festem Abstand. Dafür muss „Manuelle Steuerung“ in den nope.-Einstellungen eingeschaltet sein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Abre nope. e inicia una serie de fotos a intervalos fijos. Requiere activar Controles manuales en los ajustes de nope."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ouvre nope. et démarre une série de photos à intervalle fixe. Nécessite d’activer Commandes manuelles dans les réglages de nope."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apre nope. e avvia una serie di foto a intervalli fissi. Richiede Controlli manuali attivi nelle impostazioni di nope."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. を開いて、一定間隔の連続写真を開始します。nope. の設定で「マニュアル操作」をオンにする必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope.을(를) 열고 일정한 간격으로 사진 촬영을 시작합니다. nope. 설정에서 수동 조작을 켜야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Opent nope. en start een fotoreeks met een vaste tussentijd. Zet hiervoor Handmatige bediening aan in de instellingen van nope."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Abre o nope. e inicia uma série de fotos em intervalos fixos. É preciso ativar Controles manuais nos ajustes do nope."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "打开 nope. 并按固定间隔开始拍摄一组照片。需要在 nope. 设置中打开“手动控制”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "打開 nope. 並以固定間隔開始拍攝一系列照片。需要在 nope. 設定中開啟「手動控制」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
